# The 0.88 batch builds RNOH locally and publishes it to the local verdaccio,
# not to the public registry. Scope only the RNOH packages to verdaccio; every
# other dependency keeps resolving from the public registry. This repo uses
# Yarn 1 Classic, which reads scoped registries from .npmrc (the screens 0.88
# reference used a Yarn Berry .yarnrc.yml instead). No tokens are committed —
# verdaccio serves reads anonymously.
@zcating:registry=http://localhost:4873/
